    "text": "If a circle passing through the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;touches <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>-axis at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-intercept&nbsp;of the circle is&nbsp;"
  },
